## Non-Negotiables

1. **TypeScript strict** — Backend has `strict: true` + `noUncheckedIndexedAccess: true`. Never use `any`.
2. **ESM with `.js` suffixes** — All backend imports use `.js` extension (NodeNext resolution).
3. **Cookie auth only** — JWT in httpOnly cookie (`gradewise_token`); never localStorage/sessionStorage.
4. **Services throw `AppError`** — Routes stay thin; business logic in services.
5. **AI keys encrypted** — AES-256-GCM via `encryptSecret`/`decryptSecret`. Never log or expose keys.
6. **Config cache** — `system_configs` cached 60s. Call `invalidateConfigCache()` after writes.
7. **Google OAuth** — Backend verifies Firebase ID tokens via custom `verifyGoogleIdToken()`.
8. **RBAC** — `authenticate` + `authorize(...roles)` preHandler hooks. Roles: super_admin > admin > instructor > student.
9. **Assessment Immutability & Cloning** — Executed assessments (`is_executed === true`) are immutable. Duplicate assessments via `POST /api/assessments/:id/clone` to create a new editable version.
10. **Container Scale & FOES Prevention** — Never apply `cardInteractive` to container cards or form sections (causes click jitter; strictly use `card` or `cardElevated`). Always render skeleton loaders during initial fetch (`loading && !hasLoaded`); never render `EmptyState` prematurely.
11. **View Modularization & Monolith Prevention** — Orchestrator views in `src/views/` must stay under ~200 lines. Extract data queries/forms to custom hooks (`hooks/`) and presentation to subcomponents (`components/`). Reuse `@/components/dashboard/shared/` primitives.
12. **Backend Service Facades & Query Consolidation** — Decompose services >300 lines into focused sub-services (`*-common.ts`, `*-*.service.ts`) while preserving `<domain>.service.ts` as a backward-compatible facade. Consolidate sequential count/average queries into single SQL conditional aggregations.

